(subclass NetworkZone ComputerNetwork)
(documentation NetworkZone EnglishWrittenLanguage "A &%ComputerNetwork designated as a
security zone within a larger &%ComputerNetwork, of which it is an
&%immediateSubNetwork. Membership is represented by &%part. Whether zones may
be nested or share computer members depends on the applicable network
configuration and organizational policy. The name of a zone is given with
&%names.")
(termFormat EnglishWrittenLanguage NetworkZone "network zone")
(format EnglishWrittenLanguage NetworkZone "%1 is a network zone")

;; The zone's immediate containing network is itself a ComputerNetwork through
;; the immediateSubNetwork domain, and a subNetwork and properPart of that
;; container through the merged immediateSubNetwork/subNetwork rules.

(=>
  (instance ?ZONE NetworkZone)
  (exists (?NET)
    (immediateSubNetwork ?ZONE ?NET)))
